        "effect": "The hundreds of bats descend down into the room in a terrifying, shrieking mass. The swarm occupies a 30-foot burst on the floor of the room. All enemies within this area must attempt a DC 17 Will save. On a failure, a creature becomes frightened 1 (frightened 2 on a critical failure). The swarm then rolls initiative.",
